# Store files byte-for-byte. Inline-script CSP hashes and the SHA-256 manifests
# depend on exact bytes, so git must not rewrite line endings (CRLF <-> LF)
# on checkout -- otherwise Netlify (Linux) would build different bytes than
# were audited on Windows.
* -text
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
